	(text "Most 4-pin OLEDs are GND-VCC-SCL-SDA: JP1/JP2 come bridged 1-2 for that. For a VCC-GND-SCL-SDA\nmodule cut both 1-2 bridges and solder 2-3 on both."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 152.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9546b1b9-ad3d-57eb-9c40-0a0c4dec6b1a")
	)
	(text "U1 and U2 hang under this board facing up. The OLED's header goes in from the glass side (plastic\nbetween glass side and board); the mic sits flush, sound hole over the port."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 160.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "64d8edf5-898b-5e64-907d-87e62465de09")
	)
	(text "The mic's L/R goes to GND: its data lands in the left I2S slot (the firmware takes either)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 167.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9b1cd0ac-82ef-5425-b600-85d6e71504c8")
	)
